{
 "id": "bv-dt-right-light-dark",
 "priority": "P1",
 "title": "Video: DevTools docked right open and close (real Cmd-Opt-I), light page, dark, recorded every frame",
 "why": "Lawrence's case: the first DevTools frame in the next refresh after the key, no white flash, the page does not jump or stretch while DevTools opens or closes, and close restores the exact layout. Round 0 is the first open in the app (by the dock action), rounds 1-5 the real key.",
